Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:02.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,Outreach gets messy\Nfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.22,0:00:03.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Who did I message?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.54,0:00:04.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.63,0:00:06.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,Who needs a follow-up\Ntoday?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.68,0:00:09.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,If the answer lives in\Nyour head,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.09,0:00:10.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,you will forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.25,0:00:13.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,So I'm building the tool\Nthat answers it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.25,0:00:14.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,This is my Today screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:16.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,Follow-ups due.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:16.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,Who replied.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.97,0:00:18.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,What to do next.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:21.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every business has a\Nstage in the {\c&H1EB0F2&}pipeline,{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.28,0:00:23.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,and a full history I can\Nstep through,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:25.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,event by event.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.15,0:00:27.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,It doesn't send anything\Nfor me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.49,0:00:28.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,and it doesn't guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:30.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,It records what I do,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.56,0:00:32.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,and shows me what I\Nrecorded.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.67,0:00:35.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,I'm building it around\Nmy own outreach,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:37.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,and I'll tell you if it\Nworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.71,0:00:38.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,Andrew Builds.
